      "comment": "SELECT RONAN (1) was below best at his last couple but among the placings three back at Sale where he ran quick time (29.23). Likely to improve sharply this time. MRS. TIGGYWINKLE (8) failed to feature last start at this track, but prior to that won by 2.5 lengths at this track (23.27) beating Miss Black in a Grade 5 on July 30. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from six starts. In the mix. BLAZING BLUE ICE (7) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (26.79) in a Grade 5 at this track. Likely to be about the mark. WISE ABALONE (2) cannot be left out despite coming off a short break.",
